    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From 19th to early 22th century, manage your country energy requirements</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore map and seek new energy source sites.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build and manage energy source sites.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Organize foreign purchases and national market energy prices.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build warehouses.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start researches to improve energy production, exploration, consumption.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Promote laws and taxes to influence companies developpement.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hire characters and assign them different missions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Handle diplomatic and geostrategic incidents.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Anticipate climate variations.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face changing populations aspirations.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Control industrial developpement and its consequences.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Avoid humanity to collapse.</p></li></ul>",
